VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT python-pricing
GOAL
  Discount floors, never rounds up.
CLAIM floor REQUIRED
  ENSURE 99 at 50 percent is 49
INVARIANT tests-green CRITICAL
  ENSURE unittest suite OK
VERIFY floor
  USING py.t.floor
VERIFY tests-green
  USING py.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
